{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04737","headline":"奉和圣制赐崔日知往潞州应制 · 张说","name":"奉和圣制赐崔日知往潞州应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣情留曩镇，佳气翊兴王。\n增戟雄都府，高车转太常。\n川横八练阔，山带五龙长。\n连帅初恩命，天人旧纪纲。\n饯涂飞御藻，阖境自生光。\n明主徵循吏，何年下凤皇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04737.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04737","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}